OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse workers face #11k
OL,4,Apay cut under new council scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FDomestic abuse support workers with
OL,7,FGlasgow City Council face wage cuts of
OL,8,Fmore than #11,000 under the local
OL,9,Fauthority's new pay plans.
OL,11,FStaff at Assist, a domestic abuse
OL,12,Fadvocacy service that works with
OL,13,Fhigh-risk cases, are essentially being
OL,14,Fmoved down a pay grade after the
OL,15,Fcouncil carried out an evaluation of
OL,16,Fjobs.
OL,18,FWorkers said the evaluation left them
OL,19,Ffeeling insulted after it suggested
OL,20,Ftheir work only required them to pay
OL,21,Fattention for 30 minutes at a time.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
