OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse workers face #11k
OL,4,Apay cut under new council scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority this week said it
OL,7,Fintended to sack more than 23,000 staff
OL,8,Fand re-hire them on new contracts to
OL,9,Fimplement its new pay structure, only
OL,10,Fto halt the plan a day later.
